  "story": {
    "text": "Jane becomes the {TEACHER} of a village school. One snowy night St. John brings news: an uncle in Madeira has died and left her twenty {THOUSAND} pounds. And the Riverses are her {COUSINS}! Jane, a hard woman, impossible to put off, {INSISTS} on {SHARING} it with them: five thousand each. At last she has a {FAMILY}.",
